> _obs,num_participants,interpretation" _n

. *       file write myfile "only daugthers, `coefficient_onlyd', `se_onlyd', `
> test_stat_family', `df_residual', `df_model',`p_value_onlyd',`num_obs',`num_p
> articipants',`interpretation_onlyd'" _n // commented out by Tina Wang
.         file write myfile "`coefficient_mixed', `se_mixed', `test_stat_family
> ', `df_residual', `df_model',`p_value_mixed',`num_obs',`num_participants',`in
> terpretation_mixed'" _n

. 
.         file close myfile

. 
